<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-26T07:58:07.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:58:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces advanced in Quneitra and a Daraa officer was killed while Syrian security forces remain under directives that prevent them from confronting Israeli patrols. Hundreds of Syrians blocked the Damascus-Suwayda road to protest repeated Israeli incursions and to demand the release of detainees. Shooting attacks in northern Syria wounded three civilians and a road security officer was killed in Daraa and later buried in an official funeral. The Syrian foreign minister met Saudi King Hamad, and Damascus hosted the FORTIX 2026 security and safety expo. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSC1nQXdzUDZqdGNJdUZhVm5yVlhmRzVGeFlNTk5Ubkc3VmJCV3FjaHdsSEVnRDIta2oxR3VpNWo2LURaYTF1dFBhOGdFbmZEYktoNmZ6cWxLaDM3ZER3M0xkazExTC1uMFRFc1lSUmk5bWNYYmNoQ3kzTXY3bThBaWNpbG9WMFlfVll3eGdtMTdNLUtSUnhINFFkOV9qdkV4UWZmTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQV0c2SzN4TUFlZ2hmb0RfdVpPblBDQ1pVeFlQRzdvcE1YbEdKc2R1dUFVdTFsMXQwYmVoTVF3bkJ0bW5jUXlGQ1JnTnhNZkFYYkhuVnl1a1V3bHQ5dkRfZHdhVlA3bXR3Sk4ta01ZbUhmRGpRYUg5RjB0V1FQOXhUQkxUbm5rREFQVjdSbU9Nd1A0UGRXLUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNVEh6V3VHaTh1NmFjeVgwTWpIUl9OT3d3Y1EzckI2VU5UUzlXRVhGSk5IX1pjNXh1b0pheXAwSnlWc2owVUhfYW1OdEFCNnY1YTlxaGpYQ0lrRTJSTjNSVnBQcE1UeGxjMjUtUXZZR2pzbDQzMkZjb0tSbXFIN25FYU45LTJyMmtGbEZ1WW12U2JJZEVoT2NVNy1DT25nQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;کردپرس&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOMFUwSG44UDRrWUlUTDY1cUgxSE5ZZUZDZ3FKa3MyRWRPSkpsNklhbF96bFFMdkpzZ2lYTS1WRVN2eE0yWmFkVTY5U1hfZzB4ckpvRXg5dHpLODd4b0RWV3JiQk52czVk